          <groundspeak:finder id="836983">Coolcat21</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP271 - Medicine Hat - Ross Creek 

Posted: N50 00.736 W110 37.339

My GPSr: N50 00.73[b]7[/b] W110 37.339

My Elevation: 716 m(

It was a nice little stroll from a nearby street. I parked behind a city worker napping in his truck and was careful not to wake him as I went by. When I got close I was lucky to spot a tell-tale indent in the ground, cleared off about 3/4 inches of dirt and found the cap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;

